--  EGG SCANNER GUI  v12d  (flight + auto-claim + EXACT multi-hop drop)
--  • ⭐ Master ON/OFF toggle in the toolbar (starts OFF)
--  • Draggable, minimize, auto-fit, live 3s refresh
--  • FLY button → BodyVelocity flight at 300/s + auto-claim via UID
